            "review_title": "Review at Basta Hiro - Vincom Center Dong Khoi",
            "review_text": "spikyone8318\nBrunei Darussalam144 contributions\n0\nEveryone wanted to return for another meal!\nNov 2025 • Family\nStumbled upon this restaurant while walking around Vincom Centre. \nWas expecting an overpriced, pseudo-Western meal and oh my…oh my… oh my.. \nit was that good that when we were out at another location we saw there was a Basta Hiro there and we went there again! \nThis speaks volumes as to the quality of this restaurant franchise across locations. \n\nFrom the included bread starter, to the excellent vegetarian pasta to the camembert pizza to the perfectly cooked salmon.. words cannot describe enough.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 7, 2025",
