            "review_text": "Nhu P\n1 contribution\n0\nIt was just an ok experience\nJul 2025 • Family\nShort staffed, we had to wait for a longer time than other places even though when we came, there were just a few people. The clams were not fresh. They were fishy. My niece had a diarrhea after the dinner, which was probably caused by the food there as we hadn't eaten anything prior to that. Overall, not satisfied with the experience there. My plate was ok but waiting for a long time reduced my appetite.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nPlace an order beforehand if u don't have a lot of time. Check with the chef if u find the seafood not really fresh\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 26, 2025",
