            "review_text": "Andrey G\n2 contributions\n0\nFood poisoning at the place\nJul 2025 • Family\nMy family and I had a dinner on the 11th of July at this restaurant. At the first grance everything was fine. However, as a result of that brilliant dinner I had a hard food poisoning after eating a ceasar salad. The worst thing was that the following day we would have to travel back home having 10 hour-long flight. The staff can easily identify that this review as an authentic one. We spilt the bill. The first part was paid in cash with 1.5M VND, the second part was paid with a credit card *1915. I hope that this review will help other visitors avoid my sad experience.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 13, 2025",
