            "review_text": "Yan Cui Travel\n253 contributions\n0\nRecommended Italian-taste Japanese-style restaurant\nMay 2021 • Solo\nCouldn't believe that I made a right choice to stop by this restaurant for dinner. At first, the staff were polite to request diners to follow distancing rules due to the covid-19 spread, they were hygiene and careful to serve food and certainly I didn't wait for so long for my order dishes. The restaurant were generous to provide some free mini bread with butter for me as well as others and I really appreciated 👍 \nCouldn’t believe that there are many kinds of Italian-taste Japanese-style choices here and I lost my mind for seconds on which I should get, however, I picked green salad and ontama bolognese spaghetti then. So fresh and Italian tasty! I wish to come back with friends next time so that I can enjoy more and more food in this restaurant.\nRead more\nWritten June 8, 2021",
